{"ref":"character:yatta-cavallo","lead":[{"k":"p","c":["Yatta Cavallo is a playable character from the base game version of Vampire Survivors that was introduced in Patch 0.2.13. His starting weapon is ",{"i":"Sprite-Cherry_Bomb.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:cherry-bomb"}," ",{"t":"Cherry Bomb","r":"weapon:cherry-bomb"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["After obtaining the ",{"i":"Sprite-Chaos_Rosalia.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:chaos-rosalia"}," ",{"t":"Chaos Rosalia","r":"relic:chaos-rosalia"},", Yatta Cavallo can evolve the ",{"i":"Sprite-Cherry_Bomb.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:cherry-bomb"}," ",{"t":"Cherry Bomb","r":"weapon:cherry-bomb"}," into ",{"i":"Sprite-Yatta_Daikarin.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:yatta-daikarin"}," ",{"t":"Yatta Daikarin","r":"weapon:yatta-daikarin"}," upon reaching level 80."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["19 February 2022 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Alias","cells":[["Cavallo"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["CAVALLO"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Controller","cells":[["CharacterControllerYattaCavallo"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Cherry_Bomb.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:cherry-bomb"}," ",{"t":"Cherry Bomb","r":"weapon:cherry-bomb"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Defeat a total of 3000 Lion Heads."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 500"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[["No"]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["100"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Yatta Cavallo is unlocked by killing a total of 3,000 ",{"i":"Sprite-Lionhead.png","w":10,"h":11}," Lionheads."]},{"k":"p","c":["Once unlocked, Cavallo can be purchased for ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 500, which scales with other characters purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Cavallo can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"yattapanda\"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Cavallo's Halloween skin is unlocked by entering the Spell \"spoopyseason\". This will cause the player to begin a run in ",{"t":"The Bone Zone","r":"stage:the-bone-zone"}," with ",{"i":"Sprite-Bianca_Ramba.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:bianca-ramba"}," ",{"t":"Bianca Ramba","r":"character:bianca-ramba"},", Yatta Cavallo, ",{"i":"Sprite-Mortaccio.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:mortaccio"}," ",{"t":"Mortaccio","r":"character:mortaccio"},", or ",{"i":"Sprite-O'Sole_Meeo.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:o-sole-meeo"}," ",{"t":"O'Sole Meeo","r":"character:o-sole-meeo"}," in their Halloween costume. It is not required to reach 30:00 in the Bone Zone to have the skin unlocked, so the player can exit the stage at any time they like in order to do so."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Cavallo gains +1 ",{"i":"Sprite-Duplicator.png","w":18,"h":18,"r":"powerup:amount"}," ",{"t":"Amount","r":"powerup:amount"}," every 20 levels until level 60. The maximum Amount gained this way is +3."]},{"k":"p","c":["The following table shows how much Amount he gains by level:"]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Levels"],"h":1},{"c":["Amount"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["1-19"]},{"c":["0"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["20-39"]},{"c":["+1"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["40-59"]},{"c":["+2"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["60+"]},{"c":["+3"]}]}]},{"k":"p","c":["After the ",{"i":"Sprite-Chaos_Rosalia.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:chaos-rosalia"}," ",{"t":"Chaos Rosalia","r":"relic:chaos-rosalia"}," has been obtained, Cavallo will morph into a constellation beast upon reaching level 80 and his weapon will be evolved into ",{"i":"Sprite-Yatta_Daikarin.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:yatta-daikarin"}," ",{"t":"Yatta Daikarin","r":"weapon:yatta-daikarin"},", which will set the chance of explosion to 100%. He will also gain +2 ",{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," ",{"t":"Armor","r":"powerup:armor-stat"},", +1 ",{"i":"Sprite-Duplicator.png","w":18,"h":18,"r":"powerup:amount"}," ",{"t":"Amount","r":"powerup:amount"},", +100 ",{"i":"Sprite-Hollow_Heart.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"},", and +25% ",{"i":"Sprite-Clover.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:luck"}," ",{"t":"Luck","r":"powerup:luck"},"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[],"subs":[{"id":"gallery-sprites","title":"Sprites","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Yatta_Cavallo.png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Default Cavallo sprite."]},{"i":"Sprite-Yatta_Cavallo_(Spoopy).png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Halloween Cavallo sprite."]}]}]},{"id":"gallery-animated-sprites","title":"Animated sprites","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Animated-Yatta_Cavallo.gif","w":112,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation of default Cavallo."]},{"i":"Animated-Yatta_Cavallo_(Spoopy).gif","w":97,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation of Halloween Cavallo."]}]}]}]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 9 February 2023 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["\"spoopyseason\" spell should permanently unlock new skins for Mortaccio, Yatta Cavallo, Bianca Ramba, and O'Sole Meeo"]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 30 October 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Spoopy skin added to game."]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 19 February 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Cavallo is Italian for \"horse\", which sounds like the Italian word orso for \"bear\", hence this character's appearance."]},{"c":["During the 80s and early 90s, the adaptation of the anime series ",{"t":"Yatterman","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yatterman"}," was very popular among kids in Italy. Yatta Cavallo refers to the naming convention of the robots appearing in the anime, which was \"yatta\" combined with the name of an animal, like Yatta-Pesce (fish), Yatta-Can (dog), and obviously Yatta-Panda."]},{"c":["Cavallo, ",{"i":"Sprite-Mortaccio.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:mortaccio"}," ",{"t":"Mortaccio","r":"character:mortaccio"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Bianca_Ramba.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:bianca-ramba"}," ",{"t":"Ramba","r":"character:bianca-ramba"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-O'Sole_Meeo.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:o-sole-meeo"}," ",{"t":"O'Sole","r":"character:o-sole-meeo"}," have identical passives and stats and only differ in starting weapons."]},{"c":["Cavallo, Mortaccio, Ramba, O'Sole, and ",{"i":"Sprite-Sir_Ambrojoe.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:sir-ambrojoe"}," ",{"t":"Ambrojoe","r":"character:sir-ambrojoe"}," are able to get the highest persistent ",{"i":"Sprite-Duplicator.png","w":18,"h":18,"r":"powerup:amount"}," ",{"t":"Amount","r":"powerup:amount"}," in the base game at level 60 with 2 levels of Duplicator and the Amount PowerUp, adding a total of +6 projectiles to all applicable weapons."],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Ambrojoe gains +10 Amount as a starting bonus, but quickly loses said Amount as he levels up."]}]}},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Gav'Et-Oni_★.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:gav-et-oni"}," ",{"t":"Gav'Et-Oni ★","r":"character:gav-et-oni"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Rottin'Ghoul.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:rottin-ghoul"}," ",{"t":"Rottin'Ghoul","r":"character:rottin-ghoul"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Horse.png","w":24,"h":15,"r":"character:horse"}," ",{"t":"Horse","r":"character:horse"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Simondo_Belmont.png","w":20,"h":24,"r":"character:simondo-belmont"}," ",{"t":"Simondo Belmont","r":"character:simondo-belmont"}," can get one more persistent Amount by reaching level 80."]},{"c":["Prior to v1.3.0, Cavallo's Halloween skin would be persistent after unlocking and revert once exiting the game."]},{"c":["There used to be an oversight which allowed the player to press the \"R\" key on a QWERTY keyboard to morph Cavallo without any requirement. This was most likely a developer shortcut that was not removed, and it has since been fixed."]}]}],"subs":[]}]}